BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 385.7 Tm (2.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 385.7 Tm (Otherwise, send the driver one SMS that asks for the arrival time at the next stop, for example "Hi,) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 372.7 Tm (Acme dispatch here. What is your ETA to the delivery?". This is ETA request 1. Wait 20 minutes for) Tj ET
