BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 344.2 Tm (3.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 344.2 Tm (If 20 minutes pass after request 1 with no ETA, send the driver a second SMS that asks for the ETA.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 331.2 Tm (This is ETA request 2. Wait 20 minutes.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 315.7 Tm (4.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 315.7 Tm (If 20 minutes pass after request 2 with no ETA, send the driver a third SMS that asks for the ETA.) Tj ET
