BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 287.2 Tm (5.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 287.2 Tm (If 20 minutes pass after request 3 with no ETA, do not text the driver again. Do these three steps, in) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 274.2 Tm (this order:) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 98 258.7 Tm (a.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 114 258.7 Tm (Email the dispatcher in the load's email thread: say that the driver has not answered three ETA) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 114 245.7 Tm (requests, and ask for the ETA at the next stop.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 98 230.2 Tm (b.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 114 230.2 Tm (Open an urgent Hero task to call the driver for the ETA. In the task, list the times of the three) Tj ET
