BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 634 Tm (example "Detention at the receiver: checked in 07:05, appointment 07:30, waiting 2 h 40 min at) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 621 Tm (10:10".) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 605.5 Tm (2.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 605.5 Tm (Open a Hero task titled "Request detention at" followed by the facility name, with the same times, so) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 592.5 Tm (the Hero team can notify the facility and the customer. Mark it urgent only if the wait puts the load's) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 579.5 Tm (next appointment at risk.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 564 Tm (3.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 564 Tm (Send the driver one SMS: "Thanks, we noted your wait at the facility. Please have the in and out) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 551 Tm (times written on the paperwork.") Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 535.5 Tm (4.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 535.5 Tm (Never promise detention pay, never say whether detention will be paid, and never quote an amount,) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 522.5 Tm (even when the driver asks. Acme carrier settlement decides detention after delivery.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 507 Tm (5.) Tj ET
