BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 439.5 Tm (When this applies: the truck arrives at the delivery stop, the time to send the POD runs out, or a POD) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 426.5 Tm (arrives.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 408.5 Tm (Acme needs a signed POD for every load within 120 minutes of the truck's arrival at the delivery stop.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 395.5 Tm (The POD is the delivery receipt signed by the receiver. It shows the delivery date and time, the PO) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 382.5 Tm (number and any exceptions: shortage, damage, overage or refusal.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 364.5 Tm (When the truck arrives at the delivery stop:) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 346.5 Tm (1.) Tj ET
