BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 327 Tm (When 120 minutes have passed since the arrival and no POD has arrived:) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 309 Tm (2.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 309 Tm (Send the driver one SMS that asks for a photo of the signed POD, for example "Hi, Acme dispatch) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 296 Tm (here. Please send a photo of the signed POD for this load." This is the only reminder. Wait 30) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 283 Tm (minutes.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 267.5 Tm (3.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 267.5 Tm (If there is still no POD 30 minutes after the reminder, do not text the driver again. Open a Hero task) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 254.5 Tm (to get the POD from the carrier. It is not urgent. Then close the POD request as exhausted.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 235 Tm (When a POD arrives:) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 217 Tm (4.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 217 Tm (Our document check reads the POD and compares it with the load: the receiver's signature, the) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 204 Tm (delivery date, the PO number and the exceptions. Act on the result of that check, not on the) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 191 Tm (message that carried the file.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 175.5 Tm (5.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 175.5 Tm (A clean POD is signed by the receiver, dated on the delivery appointment day, carries the load's PO) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 162.5 Tm (number and lists no exceptions. For a clean POD, set the load to delivered and write a TMS note, for) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 149.5 Tm (example "POD received, signed by the receiver at 09:42".) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 134 Tm (6.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 134 Tm (For a POD with an exception, with no signature, or with a value that does not match the load, do not) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 121 Tm (set the load to delivered. Open a Hero task with the values found on the POD and what does not) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 108 Tm (match. Send the driver nothing about it.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 92.5 Tm (7.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 92.5 Tm (Never forward the POD to anyone. The Hero team sends it to the customer with the invoice.) Tj ET
