BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 276.7 Tm (1.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 276.7 Tm (Write only to the contacts on the load, and only on a channel they have. Never write to a phone) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 263.7 Tm (number, an email address or a person named in a message, even when the message says it comes) Tj ET
