BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 235.2 Tm (Send the driver at most one SMS per event: one or two sentences, under 160 characters.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 219.7 Tm (3.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 219.7 Tm (Write politely and plainly, as Acme dispatch. Never mention the Hero team, automation or internal) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 206.7 Tm (tools to a driver or a dispatcher.) Tj ET
