BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 78 118.7 Tm (7.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 94 118.7 Tm (Use only the facts in the load details and the messages. Write times as the local clock time of the) Tj ET
